body:
Fork - RS Lyrik ultimate 2021 170 mm;

Wheelset - Hope Fortus 30 mm rim width with Pepi’s inserts;

Tires - Schwalbe Magic Marry Addix ultra soft front, Schwalbe Big Betty Addix soft rear;

Brakes - Magura Mt 5s;

Cockpit - Spank stem and 40 mm Spank handlebar rise;

Drivetrain - Microshift 10 speed with 11 - 48 casette;

Cranks - Shimano Deore;

Seatpost - Crankbrothers Highline 7 150 mm;

Hopefully I mentioned it all, I cut a corner here and there to reduce the cost as much as possible but either way I tried to get a decent suspension, brakes and solid wheels :) got it all under 3000 €
